typedef struct{int*a;int n,cap;}MedianFinder;MedianFinder*medianFinderCreate(){MedianFinder*p=calloc(1,sizeof(*p));p->cap=16;p->a=malloc(p->cap*sizeof(int));return p;}void medianFinderAddNum(MedianFinder*p,int x){if(p->n==p->cap){p->cap*=2;p->a=realloc(p->a,p->cap*sizeof(int));}int i=p->n++;while(i>0&&p->a[i-1]>x){p->a[i]=p->a[i-1];i--;}p->a[i]=x;}double medianFinderFindMedian(MedianFinder*p){return p->n%2?p->a[p->n/2]:((double)p->a[p->n/2-1]+p->a[p->n/2])/2;}void medianFinderFree(MedianFinder*p){free(p->a);free(p);}
